	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『Fate/Grand Order』より、プレイヤーの分身となる女性主人公がぷちりっつシリーズにラインアップ！",
			"• いろプラを活用したカラフルで組み立てやすいキット。シンプルなパーツ構成で初心者でも手軽に楽しめる組み立てやすさを実現。",
			"• ３頭身ながら、キャラクターの特徴あるシルエットラインそのままに、印象を崩すことなくかわいくデフォルメ。",
			"• 上半身の可動によりプロポーションを崩さずに表情あるポージングが可能。",
			"• 右手の令呪はシールで再現。手首の付け替えで特徴的なポーズでのディスプレイも可能。",
			"• 別売りの「ぷちりっつ シールダー/マシュ・キリエライト」に取り付けられるマシュ用笑顔表情パーツが付属。",
			"• キャラクターをイメージした専用台座が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Fate/Grand Order\", the female protagonist who becomes the player's alter ego is added to the Petitrits series!",
			"• A colorful and easy-to-assemble kit that utilizes Iropla. The simple parts structure makes it easy to assemble, even for beginners.",
			"• Although he has three heads, he maintains the character's distinctive silhouette line and is cutely deformed without losing his impression.",
			"• The upper body can be moved to create expressive poses without changing the proportions.",
			"• The command spell on the right hand is reproduced with Seal. You can also display it in a distinctive pose by changing the wrists.",
			"• Comes with a smiling expression part for Mash that can be attached to the separately sold \"Petitrits Seal Dar/Mash Kyrielight\".",
			"• A special pedestal inspired by the character is included."
		]
	},
